Health plan
Pension
13th Month bonus
Free Lunch

Job Description
Senior Data Officer responsibilities include conducting full lifecycle analysis to include requirements, activities and design.
Senior Data Officer will develop analysis and reporting capabilities.
He/she will also monitor performance to identify improvements.
Duties & Responsibilities
Perform data analyzing to present findings, or translate the data into an understandable document;
Collect and collate data to use it to help the organisation to make better decisions;
Interpreting data, analyzing results using statistical techniques;
Acquiring data from primary or secondary data sources and maintaining databases;
Developing and implementing data analyses, data collection systems and other strategies that optimize statistical efficiency and quality;
