HND / Bachelor's Degree with 4-6 years experience in the related field. Bachelor in Economics, Computer Science, Statistics, Business Administration.
Strong knowledge of Google Suite would be an advantage;
Previous work experience in NGOs would be an advantage;
Demonstrated ability to maintain accuracy & confidentiality in performing responsibilities;
Strong analytical skills with the ability to collect, organize, analyze, and disseminate significant amounts of information with attention to detail and accuracy;
Technical expertise regarding data models, database design development, data mining and segmentation techniques;
Strong knowledge of and experience with reporting packages, databases;
Demonstrated proficiency with Microsoft Office applications, knowledge of statistics and experience using statistical packages for analyzing data sets (SPSS, etc.);
Adept at queries, report writing and presenting findings;
Strong interpersonal & intercultural skills with an attention to detail;

Organization Background
YOPCODI is a Nigerian Non-Governmental Organization (NNGO) that envision a society where communities have equitable access to social and economic services.
YOPCODI works for the sustenance of peace and development in volatile and resettled communities affected by insurgency, with focus on responding to the immediate, short and long-term needs of affected children and women in Northeast Nigeria.
